1: ## Our Impact\nL92: \nL93: Take a closer look at how our work to provide liquidity, stability and affordability to the housing market is Making Home Possible across the map.\nL94: \nL95: cite62†Learn More L96: \nL97:   *   *   *   * ## Single-Family\nL98: \nL99: Our Single-Family division leads the industry in meeting the needs of Sellers/Servicers, streamlining processes and bringing down costs.\nL100: \nL101: cite2†Learn More†sf.freddiemac.com L102: ## Multifamily\nL103: \nL104: Our Multifamily Division is a market-driven business that responds to the needs of our customers, delivering best-in-class execution for loans and investor offerings.\nL105: \nL106: cite4†Learn More†mf.freddiemac.com L107: \nL108:   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   * cite63†Corporate July 30, 2026 Transcript: Freddie Mac CFO Discusses Second Quarter 2026 Financial and Business Results We continued our solid performance in the second quarter of 2026, generating $3.8 billion in net income. L109: cite64†Outlook January 24, 2025 Economic, Housing and Mortgage Market Outlook – January 2025 The U.S. economy grew at a stronger pace than initially estimated in the third quarter of 2024 while the labor market remains resilient. L110: \nL111:   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   * ## Media Contact\nL112: \nL113: For Press Inquiries Only\nL114: Phone: (703) 903-3933\nL115: Email: cite65†[email protected] L116: \nL117: For non-press inquiries, visit our cite66†FAQs page.\nL118: \nL119:   *   *   *   *   *   *   * ## Join Us In Making Home Possible\nL120: Freddie Mac is where ambitious possibility-makers and relentless doers are shaping the U.S. housing industry.\nL121: \nL122: cite54†Learn More†careers.freddiemac.com L123: ## Search for Career Opportunities\nL124: \nL125: Search our open opportunities and discover how you can help drive our business forward.\nL126: \nL127: cite55†Job Search†careers.freddiemac.com L128: \nL129: Enter your search [Input: Enter your search]\